    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "RECORD OF REVISIONS\nRevision\n1. Original Printing in New Format\n2.\n3.\nDate\nMar. 31 2014\n5\nPilot Rule Book",
      "INTRODUCTION\nCHAPTER 1 - YOUR SENIORITY\nA. YOUR COMPANY SENIORITY\nB.\nYOUR PILOT SENIORITY\nC. SENIORITY PROTECTIONS\nCHAPTER 2 - CERTIFICATES, PASSPORTS \u0026 UNIFORMS\nA. AIRMAN AND MEDICAL CERTIFICATES\nB. PASSPORTS\nC. INTERNATIONAL REQUIREMENTS\nD. PILOT UNIFORMS\nCHAPTER 3 - BASES AND COMMUTING\nA. PILOT BASES\nB. ALTERNATE LINES OF FLYING\nC. NO DISPLACEMENT RULE\nD. VOLUNTARY TRANSFERS\nE.\nCREW PARKING AND TRANSIT BENEFITS\nF. FLIGHT DECK AND CABIN JUMPSEAT PRIVILEGES\nG. COMMUTING RULES\nCHAPTER 4 - TRAINING\nA. TRAINING - IN GENERAL\nBIDDING FOR RECURRENT TRAINING\nTRAVEL To AND FROM TRAINING EVENTS\nREST SURROUNDING TRAINING EVENTS\nCAPTAIN UPGRADES\nF.\nREMEDIAL TRAINING AND FAILED TRAINING EVENTS\nBYPASSING UPGRADE\nH. TRAINING AFTER RETURNING FROM LEAVE\nPilot Rule Book\n1\n2\n2\n5\n5\n6\n7\n10\n11\n12\n12\n14\n15\n17\n17\n18\n20\n21\n21\n22\n25\n26",
      "Nigin\namerica\nVIRGIN AMERICA\nPILOT RULE BOOK\nvirgin america"
